From: Aqueous contributors <zoey@seafoam-labs.org>
Subject: [PATCH] output, scene: support compositor-owned Xwayland projection

A rootless Xwayland client needs a physical-pixel output model while ordinary
Wayland clients continue to consume the compositor's logical model. Add a
per-client output projection callback and a scene-surface destination scale so
compositors can implement that policy without changing global output state.

